  "notes": "Synthetic. Truth is what each line actually does at run time. The engine resolves within one file in v0, so the client built by app/factory.py:make_client and the constant in app/settings.py are reported as gaps at their use sites (dynamic.py:34 and :21) and recorded here as known misses. dynamic.py:38 receives an untyped parameter that nothing in the fixture calls, so its provider is not knowable and it is a gap only. app/sms.py (Twilio messages.create) and app/pricing.py (model IDs in a price table) must report nothing. venv/ and libs/_vendor/ hold one SDK call each and must be excluded and counted."
